   its relationship to the official project, must be marked as modified, and must not
   use the name "RPG Web", "Savaş Stüdyosu" or any confusingly similar name as its own
   primary title, nor imply endorsement by the licensor, without written permission.

4. **Contributions.** Contributions submitted to the official repository are licensed to
   the licensor as described in CONTRIBUTING.md and CLA.md, and may be distributed under
